# The camera original of the portrait. It carries EXIF GPS coordinates,
# device and timestamp — publishing it would put the exact location where
# the photo was taken into a public repository. The published portrait.jpg
# at the repo root is a resized copy with all metadata stripped.
# Delete this line only if you have stripped the original's metadata too.
Images/

# By-products of compiling the CV with xelatex or latexmk. Only CV/cv.tex
# and the compiled CV/cv.pdf are tracked; Tectonic leaves none of these.
CV/*.aux
CV/*.log
CV/*.out
CV/*.fls
CV/*.fdb_latexmk
CV/*.synctex.gz
CV/*.xdv
